=u(-t).$\n\n- Next, we shift $y=u(-t)$ vertically upwards by $2$ units, giving $y=u(-t)+2.$\n\n- There is no horizontal shift or vertical scaling.\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $f(t)=u(-t)+2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-352909/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "253b1011-a313-5004-8cbe-61133586e6b1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-352909"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-331267/selection/f912e99cd02f0b2adbfee9b8a92c8ee912a2c0945833aa4221d10ef469e3c20a" :answer/id #uuid "b67bd27d-0472-5836-b595-e122a08c69a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "u(-1-t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331267/selection/d598594d56b74c34788e65c78875960575e6c98c5bd3010418e9d1e4659601fa" :answer/id #uuid "9a3c0ea6-2003-5f75-8604-a7a0b20f38f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "u(1-t)+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331267/selection/c2a2d488c6767b644d40fc0b7b350a93ea548fecc9a2009cae2d5f46c52499d6" :answer/id #uuid "feed8e4e-ac40-59db-b227-a446140c2cce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2u(1-t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331267/selection/829b3930583e141a0ce52144501442c6c6de79c395438fc37ac1abec2dcd19ff" :answer/id #uuid "0b59a5f2-08d2-53a2-8d02-197f9b6491d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "u(t-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331267/selection/fc9dd2c81af77b48d24e66586fd3ad5454068a5d4eaa5db05b7828cbc841bad2" :answer/id #uuid "6aadd213-8803-5d03-99a0-d02baaa4acba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "u(1-t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331267/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a9db1c33-43d0-5cbf-9a18-59bf7f9b0dc6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-331267/selection/fc9dd2c81af77b48d24e66586fd3ad5454068a5d4eaa5db05b7828cbc841bad2" :answer-field/choices ["q-331267/selection/f912e99cd02f0b2adbfee9b8